LIBRARY BORROWING SYSTEM
Overview:
The Library Borrowing System is a Python-based application designed to manage book borrowings, calculate fines for late returns, send email notifications, and provide a web-based dashboard for monitoring records.
The system processes input data from CSV files, validates records, computes fines based on borrowing duration, and generates reports. It also supports sending automated email notifications for late returns.

Features:
Record validation for books and borrow entries
Fine calculation for late returns
Automated email notifications for overdue fines
Report generation (fine report and book usage summary)
Web-based dashboard using Flask
Unit testing for core modules

Project Structure:
bookborrowingsystem/
│
├── main.py
